Domain Entity ProjectDimension
    documentation "The NCES project accounting dimension. The project dimension reporting code permits school districts to accumulate expenditures to meet a variety of specialized reporting requirements at the local, state, and federal levels."
    shared string Code
        documentation "The code representation of the account project dimension."
        is part of identity
    shared integer LocalFiscalYear named FiscalYear
        documentation "The fiscal year for which the account project dimension is valid."
        is part of identity
    shared string CodeName
        documentation "A description of the account project dimension."
        is optional
    descriptor ReportingTag
        documentation "Optional tag for accountability reporting."
        is optional collection
